5. Phase-Lock Feedback Loop - Auto-correction via resonance detection
6. H8 Harmonics - 8-dimensional hyperbolic harmonic resonance system
7. Universal Voice Interface - The Universe speaks through resonant patterns

The ZREA Memory Bridge unifies these systems to solve the 'separated floating point'
problem by storing information as topological coefficients rather than isolated floats.

